# The cut points of `Utf16_To_Utf8_Calc` (PLAN.md §M, M1)

The 7 cut points: the entry and where two ways meet. From each, the blocks up to the next cut points as one
piece (`W_*`, with its `Sp`, `c_*`): a block's straight-line code, then at its jump's exits the next block's condition,
or `Q` at a cut point or at an offset the proof does not go past (122, 136; the `ret`). `Wt` is the table of the cut
points' conditions, `spAll` its `Sp`s, for `Seg.cfg`. Generated by `tools/blk_gen.py`.
-/
